---
description: Project rules for mobile strategy Godot game
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `MASTER_PROJECT_PLAN.md` first. Follow `AGENTS.md` and `AI_TOOLING_GUIDE.md`.

- `MASTER_PROJECT_PLAN.md` is the highest source of truth.
- Use Godot Engine 4.x.
- Primary OpenCode model: ChatGPT 5.5 (`openai/gpt-5.5`).
- Portrait-only.
- Android and iPhone/iOS required.
- Required Spec Kit depth is 4; max depth is 4.
- Every node at every depth must use full Spec Kit.
- Do not create shallow placeholder nodes.
- Do not implement the game before Spec Kit tasks exist.
- Prioritize final game quality, clarity, game feel, and artifacts over prototype shortcuts.
- Context7, Repomix, Task Master, BMAD, and Kiro follow `AI_TOOLING_GUIDE.md`.
